<newsitem itemid="109605" id="root" date="1996-10-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Ferguson pretax profit rises to 6.0 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Ferguson pretax profit rises to 6.0 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) adjusted   10.1		   vs 11.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.5		    vs 4.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    6.0		    vs 5.6</p>
<p> Turnover (continuing)  70.6		   vs 64.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Ferguson International Holdings Plc, which manufactures labels, said turnover, including discontinued operations, was 85.3 million stg compared with 104.5 million stg for the same period the previous year.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 6.68		   vs 7.93</p>
<p> Interest paid	    0.69		   vs 1.4</p>
<p> Tax paid		   1.92		   vs 2.23</p>
<p> Net taxed		  4.08		   vs 3.41</p>
<p> Pay date		   December 5</p>
<p> Div registration date  November 12</p>
<p> Ex-div date		November 4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
